The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-e2cdfec3650643b25102907916df41e26533d127 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-0b99de67f239d9fa09c6009d0e28aa01286d924c "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].